test: drop the unobservable NVDA skip-link assertion

NVDA browse navigation never surfaces the off-screen fixed-position skip link
(confirmed from the real spoken log), and press("Tab") did not reach it either.
The skip link's keyboard behaviour is already tested deterministically in the
Linux gate (keyboard.spec.ts), so keep only the landmark test, which is the
suite's unique value and passes.
